Data and imagery
----------------
- NASA FIRMS fire detections (MODIS C6.1, VIIRS C2 on Suomi-NPP / NOAA-20 / NOAA-21), 7-day
  global CSVs. NASA open data; the daily values shown for 2000-11-01 onward are a labelled
  reconstruction calibrated to the live window, not a re-download of the FIRMS archive.
- NASA POWER (MERRA-2) daily meteorology, fetched per area with no key. NASA open data.
- CelesTrak general perturbations element sets for Terra, Aqua, Suomi-NPP, NOAA-20 and NOAA-21,
  bundled statically (epoch 2026-303). CelesTrak data is provided free of charge with attribution.
- NASA Visible Earth imagery: Blue Marble day mosaic, Black Marble 2012 night lights, cloud
  composite — public domain / NASA imagery, downscaled to 2048x1024 for this app.
- Natural Earth 110m coastline/land vector data (public domain) used for the land topology.
- "Laika the Explorer" 3D model by beagleknight, CC BY 4.0, bundled as public/models/pet1.glb.
  Source: https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/laika-the-explorer-33dbae0c33a44422bccf753710c3910b
  Author: https://sketchfab.com/beagleknight
  License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Display changes: framed to the companion viewport, lit and animated in the app.

